// (nt, kt) is 256 contiguous bytes holding element (k, n) at (n%16)*16 + k%16,
// tiles ordered kt-fastest. The plane is k-major inside an n-tile — scale
// (nt, group g, n%16) at (nt*kgroups + g)*16 + n%16 — so the sixteen scales a
